        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift\n- Products: Red\n- Events: The Red Tour\n- Places: Omaha, Nebraska; Singapore\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift released Red as her fourth studio album in 2012.\n- The Red Tour was Taylor Swift's third concert tour and supported her fourth studio album, Red.\n- The Red Tour began on March 13, 2013 in Omaha, Nebraska.\n- The Red Tour concluded on June 12, 2014 in Singapore.\n- By June 12, 2014, The Red Tour had grossed over $150 million and became the highest-grossing tour of all time by a country artist.",
